      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "AWS is an IT infrastructure\n\n\n\nThey have invested billlions of dollars to buy and setup the \nIT infrastructure and are offering a small portion of it as a \nservice to any user → entreprise or individuals\n\nThey are datacenters present across the globe\n\nThe infrastructure provided to the users are isolated and I need\nnot worry about the breach of privacy or any other entity accidentally \nor intentionally accessing the data the entity does not have access to.\n\nಆವಾಗ ಆವಾಗ pay ಮಾಡಿಕೊಂಡು ಸಾಲ ತೀರಸಿದರೆ ಸಾಕು \n\nಯಾವ ಯಾವಾತರ infra ಕೊಡ್ತಾರೆ ಅಂದರೆ \n1. Compute -> Hardware -> Graphics card ಬೇಕ or RAM ಜಾಸ್ತಿ ಬೇಕ\nನಾನು worry ಮಾಡುವ ಅವಶ್ಯಕತೆ ಇಲ್ಲ \n2. Storage → upfront HDD or SSD ಬೇಕು ಅಂದರೆ I can just keep paying\nand getting a Simple Storage Service (S3) use ಮಾಡಬಹುದು ⭐\n3. Database -> scale ಆಗೋ noSQL DB as a service or RDS → relational\ndatabase which also scales use madbodu\n\n",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "AWS is an IT infrastructure\n\n\n\nThey have invested billlions of dollars to buy and setup the \nIT infrastructure and are offering a small portion of it as a \nservice to any user → entreprise or individuals\n\nThey are datacenters present across the globe\n\nThe infrastructure provided to the users are isolated and I need\nnot worry about the breach of privacy or any other entity accidentally \nor intentionally accessing the data the entity does not have access to.\n\nಆವಾಗ ಆವಾಗ pay ಮಾಡಿಕೊಂಡು ಸಾಲ ತೀರಸಿದರೆ ಸಾಕು \n\nಯಾವ ಯಾವಾತರ infra ಕೊಡ್ತಾರೆ ಅಂದರೆ \n1. Compute -> Hardware -> Graphics card ಬೇಕ or RAM ಜಾಸ್ತಿ ಬೇಕ\nನಾನು worry ಮಾಡುವ ಅವಶ್ಯಕತೆ ಇಲ್ಲ \n2. Storage → upfront HDD or SSD ಬೇಕು ಅಂದರೆ I can just keep paying\nand getting a Simple Storage Service (S3) use ಮಾಡಬಹುದು ⭐\n3. Database -> scale ಆಗೋ noSQL DB as a service or RDS → relational\ndatabase which also scales use madbodu\n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
